    {
      "name": "👤 Account - 帳號管理",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "STEP1: checkUsernameUsed - 檢查帳號是否已連結",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "    console.log('Code: ' + jsonData.code);",
                  "    console.log('Message: ' + jsonData.message);",
                  "    if (jsonData.data) {",
                  "        console.log('isLinked: ' + jsonData.data.isLinked);",
                  "        console.log('usernameType: ' + jsonData.data.usernameType);",
                  "        if (jsonData.data.existMembers && jsonData.data.existMembers.length > 0) {",
                  "            console.log('existMembers count: ' + jsonData.data.existMembers.length);",
                  "            jsonData.data.existMembers.forEach(function(m, i) {",
                  "                console.log('  [' + i + '] serialNumber: ' + m.serialNumber + ', hasECAccount: ' + m.hasECAccount + ', ssoAccountId: ' + m.ssoAccountId);",
                  "            });",
                  "        }",
                  "    }",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"username\": \"0912345678\",\n    \"clientId\": \"{{client_id}}\",\n    \"clientSecret\": \"{{client_secret}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/service/account/checkUsernameUsed",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "service",
                "account",
                "checkUsernameUsed"
              ]
            },
            "description": "STEP1: 登入頁面1 - 輸入手機號碼或 Email，檢查是否已經連結帳號。\n\n回傳:\n- isLinked: 是否已連結\n- usernameType: MOBILE 或 EMAIL\n- existMembers: 關聯的會員資料（未連結時才有值）\n  - serialNumber, hasECAccount, ssoAccountId 等"
          },
          "response": []
        },
